    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d595">

                <pb facs="0572" n="400" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg400"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.85/291</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-15T13:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 15, 1918, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 2.36 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your December 14, 5 p.m.,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d595-f1"/> and January 12, 5
                        p.m.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d595-f2"/> President endeavoring to find legal way
                    to conform with board’s wishes. Believes will succeed in doing so this week.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
